2. Fonts embedded through typst-assets 0.15.1
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
The "embedded-fonts" feature of typst-kit compiles 17 unmodified font faces
into matheme.dll: Libertinus Serif (6), New Computer Modern (7) and
DejaVu Sans Mono (4).

SIL Open Font License 1.1 (with Reserved Font Names) and the Bitstream Vera /
DejaVu notices apply. The full OFL text, each family's copyright statement and
the base-14 PDF font notices are reproduced verbatim in
third-party/NOTICE-typst-assets. These fonts may be bundled with software but
may not be sold on their own; no font file has been modified or renamed.

Fonts read at runtime from a Wolfram installation are not redistributed here.

