4. Remaining Rust dependencies
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Approximately 419 crates in total, predominantly MIT, Apache-2.0,
MIT OR Apache-2.0, Unicode-3.0, BSD-2-Clause, BSD-3-Clause, Zlib, Unlicense,
