present in any built matheme.dll. Anyone redistributing a build must satisfy
the MathLink terms independently of the Apache-2.0 license on Matheme's code.
The Wolfram Language kernel and the Wolfram/ErrorTools paclet are runtime
requirements supplied by the user, not bundled by this project.

